(SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE BOARD OF INDIA) Tj
T*
(CORPORATION FINANCE DEPARTMENT, MUMBAI) Tj
T*
(SEBI/HO/CFD/CFD-PoD-1/P/CIR/2024/138) Tj
T*
(September 14, 2024) Tj
T*
(SEBI \(LODR\) Regulations - Timelines for Disclosure of Material Events) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Regulation 30 Materiality Timelines: Listed entities must disclose material events or information to the stock exchanges within) Tj
T*
(the following strict statutory timelines:) Tj
T*
(\(a\) Board Meeting Decisions: Disclosures regarding dividends, financial results, voluntary delisting, buyback, or alteration in capital) Tj
T*
(structure must be made within 30 minutes of the closure of the board meeting.) Tj
T*
(\(b\) Events Originating Within the Listed Entity: Any material event originating from within the company \(e.g., strikes, lockouts, senior) Tj
T*
(management resignations, acquisition agreements\) must be disclosed within 12 hours of occurrence.) Tj
T*
(\(c\) Events Originating Outside the Listed Entity: Material events originating outside the company \(e.g., regulatory raids, court orders,) Tj
T*
(litigation filings\) must be disclosed within 24 hours of the company becoming aware of the event.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
9 0 obj
<< /Length 863 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 720 Td
13 TL
(2. Quantitative Threshold for Materiality: An event or information shall be treated as objectively material if the financial impact) Tj
T*
(exceeds any of the following quantitative criteria:) Tj
T*
(\(i\) two percent of turnover, based on the last audited consolidated financial statements of the listed entity;) Tj
T*
(\(ii\) two percent of net worth, based on the last audited consolidated financial statements;) Tj
T*
(\(iii\) five percent of the average of absolute value of profit or loss after tax, based on the last three audited consolidated financial statements.) Tj
T*
(3. Market Rumor Verification: The top 100 listed entities \(and from April 1, 2025, the top 250 listed entities\) shall confirm, deny,) Tj
T*
(or clarify any market rumors reported in mainstream financial media within 24 hours of publication.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
