(7. Cyber Security Incident Disclosures: Any cyber security incident or breach or loss of data impacting the operations of the) Tj
T*
(listed entity must be disclosed to the stock exchanges within 24 hours of occurrence. Additionally, details must be included in the) Tj
T*
(quarterly corporate governance report submitted within 21 days of quarter end.) Tj
T*
(8. Material Contracts with Related Parties: Agreements entered into with related parties or promoters not in the ordinary course of) Tj
T*
(business or not at arm's length must be disclosed within 12 hours.) Tj
T*
(9. Action Taken by Regulatory Bodies: Any search, seizure, raid, summons, or regulatory enforcement order issued against the listed) Tj
T*
(entity or its directors by any statutory authority must be disclosed within 24 hours.) Tj
T*
(Yours faithfully,) Tj
T*
(\(Rajesh Kumar Dangeti\)) Tj
T*
(Chief General Manager) Tj
T*
